<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Campus To Home Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I book campus to home packers and movers for my college relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: visit the Shree Ashirwad website, enter your campus address, destination home address, and preferred moving date. Our instant estimate tool generates a quote, after which you can confirm the booking online or via phone. A dedicated relocation manager will then coordinate pickup, packing, transit, and delivery, ensuring a hassle‑free campus to home move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from campus to home?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a campus to home shift, you need a valid government‑issued ID, the campus’s relocation clearance letter, the destination address proof (utility bill or rental agreement), and a GSTIN copy if the move is corporate‑reimbursable. Shree Ashirwad also prepares the e‑Way bill and any IBA‑required paperwork to ensure smooth checkpoint clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my belongings fully insured during the 850 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100% declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage throughout the 850 km journey. In the unlikely event of a claim, Shree Ashirwad handles documentation and settlement promptly, giving you peace of mind for your campus to home relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the moving cost calculated for campus to home shifting?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is derived from four components: a base fare covering handling and loading, a distance surcharge based on the 850 km route, a fuel surcharge reflecting current diesel rates, and optional services such as premium packing or storage. The instant estimate tool breaks down each element, providing a transparent campus to home packers and movers tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels from campus to home?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All Shree Ashirwad container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices. Once your goods leave the campus, you receive a tracking link that shows live location, estimated arrival time, and checkpoint status. Real‑time updates keep you informed throughout the campus to home journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packing materials are used to protect fragile items during the campus to home move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a 7‑layer protective system: 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap for cushioning, high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated fiberboard sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate items such as glassware or temple statues. This ensures maximum safety for every campus to home relocation.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
